        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Toby Kebbell\n- Films: Dead Man's Shoes, RocknRolla, War Horse, Wrath of the Titans, Dawn of the Planet of the Apes, Fantastic Four, Warcraft, A Monster Calls, Gold\n- Franchises: Warcraft, Azeroth\n- Topics: Film roles, Adaptation sources\n\nFacts:\n- Toby Kebbell is known for his role in the film Dead Man's Shoes (2004).\n- Toby Kebbell is known for his role in the film RocknRolla (2008).\n- Toby Kebbell is known for his role in the film War Horse (2011).\n- Toby Kebbell is known for his role in the film Wrath of the Titans (2012).\n- Toby Kebbell is known for his role in the film Dawn of the Planet of the Apes (2014).\n- Toby Kebbell is known for his role in the film Fantastic Four (2015).\n- Toby Kebbell is known for his roles in the films Warcraft, A Monster Calls, and Gold (2016).\n- The film Warcraft is based on the Warcraft video game series and on novels set in the world of Azeroth.",
